  "description": "This vegan queso dip is packed with a gooey cashew- and potato-based nacho sauce, soy-lentil chorizo, avocados, scallions, tomatoes with chiles, and black beans. The flavor is so good, that even your omnivore friends won't know that it's vegan.",
  "notes": "Optional or for serving: 1 serrano or jalapeño pepper, minced (reserve a few whole slices for garnish, if desired)\n\nNotes: If Ro*Tel tomatoes are unavailable, substitute with 1 (425 g) can of drained diced tomatoes, mixed with 1 (113 g) can of drained chopped green chiles.",
